<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">21042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Tokyo has lifted an eighty-year postwar ban on exporting finished weapons, clearing fighters, missiles, and destroyers for sale to seventeen partner nations.</s> <s>The cabinet's carve-out lets ministers authorize wartime sales at their own discretion — the clause regional neighbors are reading most carefully.</s> <s>Japan's pacifist constitutional settlement, once a shock absorber for the whole Pacific, is being dismantled piece by piece.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Twin shutdowns paralyzed Manipur after a blast killed two children as they slept in Bishnupur district.</s> <s>Meitei and Naga communities imposed simultaneous protests, the closest thing to joint action India's three-year ethnic conflict has produced.</s> <s>Delhi handed both cases to the National Investigation Agency, but lawyers say containment isn't resolution.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gaza's ten-year reconstruction bill has been set at seventy-one point four billion dollars, with twenty-six point three billion needed within eighteen months.</s> <s>The joint EU, UN, and World Bank assessment documented three hundred seventy-one thousand destroyed homes and an eighty-four percent economic contraction.</s> <s>Trump proposed clearing the strip for resorts; the report conditions every dollar on Palestinian governance of the rebuild.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Israeli soldier was photographed sledgehammering a Jesus statue in the southern Lebanese village of Debl, which the IDF still occupies months past the October ceasefire.</s> <s>The Rossing Center logged one hundred fifty-five anti-Christian incidents inside Israel last year alone.</s> <s>Netanyahu vowed discipline... Debl's mayor demanded equal accountability for the homes still under Israeli boots.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Caracas opened Venezuela's gold mines to foreign investors under a new law, even as armed groups including the National Liberation Army still control production.</s> <s>Washington lifted gold sanctions in January, and traders are moving in before the mines themselves are cleared.</s> <s>The extraction economy is being legalized faster than it's being secured.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon has killed an eight-billion-dollar GPS satellite program after Raytheon's contract ballooned, slipped nine years past deadline, and still failed testing.</s> <s>Space Force will keep running satellite navigation from its legacy nineteen-nineties control stations.</s> <s>Every dollar burned on failed procurement is a dollar unavailable for the overseas posture it was meant to support.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Islamabad raised three hundred ninety million dollars through its first hybrid Sukuk, pairing conventional and Shariah-compliant tranches to reach Gulf Islamic capital pools outside the eurobond market.</s> <s>Pakistan repaid two billion dollars to the <sub alias="United Arab Emirates">UAE</sub> the same week, ahead of its next IMF review.</s> <s>A starved sovereign is learning to borrow in the Islamic finance architecture it helped build.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones struck Russia's only Black Sea refinery at Tuapse for the second time in four days, killing one worker.</s> <s>Vessel-tracking data showed ship calls to Tuapse halving, with traffic diverted one hundred sixty kilometres north to Novorossiysk, which recorded twenty percent more arrivals.</s> <s>Moscow's export geography is being rewritten one refinery at a time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>All six of Nigeria's North-central states missed the twenty-six percent education spending benchmark, with Benue leading at just twenty-one point four percent.</s> <s>Actual disbursement runs lower still, as states release less than they approve.</s> <s>Nasarawa raised its share despite a twenty-five percent out-of-school rate... and no federal enforcement exists.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Renewables overtook coal as the world's largest source of electricity last year, and for the first time outside a global crisis, fossil generation fell in absolute terms.</s> <s>Solar alone met seventy-five percent of demand growth, adding six hundred forty-seven gigawatts — its fourth straight year leading the expansion.</s> <s>The cost curve has finally outpaced demand, and the inflection isn't a forecast anymore.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Durban-led CAPRISA trial showed an annual subdermal implant maintained protective tenofovir levels for twelve months in South African women.</s> <s>Daily oral prophylaxis has been the adherence bottleneck across sub-Saharan Africa for a decade; one procedure a year reframes the arithmetic.</s> <s>Tissue tolerability issues remain, but the dosing target's been cleared.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Twenty-four scientists have demanded fifty nations attending Colombia's Santa Marta summit reject natural gas as a bridge fuel.</s> <s>The panel, convened outside UN climate channels, handed Bogotá twelve action steps including an immediate halt on new fossil expansion.</s> <s>Whether the summit adopts them will tell us whether the Global South can lead climate diplomacy where the UN process has stalled.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Seoul's chipmakers and Micron have shifted production to high-bandwidth AI memory, leaving dynamic RAM for phones and laptops in short supply.</s> <s>Forecasts show only sixty percent of consumer demand met by the end of twenty-twenty-seven.</s> <s>The data centre is outbidding the household, and the price signal is starting to reach ordinary shelves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brussels will ban glued phone batteries from February twenty-twenty-seven under the twenty-twenty-three Batteries Regulation.</s> <s>The rule mandates five years of spare parts, forbids proprietary tools, and is enforced at retail across all twenty-seven member states.</s> <s>A decade of disposable design is being legislated out of the European market.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>French prosecutors have summoned Elon Musk for questioning over alleged child sexual abuse material, deepfake images, and Holocaust denial generated by X's Grok chatbot.</s> <s>Washington refused cooperation, calling the probe politically motivated.</s> <s>Paris is testing whether a European state can still compel an American platform owner to answer in person.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>